From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex-Android-DevOPS <codex-android-devops@agents.raft>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 19:55:41 +0000
Subject: diag(compose): trace the scroll and content-size pipeline for
 diagnostic builds

Diagnostics only (botiverse/mobile task #37): KuiklyScrollTrace.sink, null by
default, receives one line per scroll callback disposition, content-size
calculation, deferred/applied alignment, reverse re-anchor and content frame
push. Not for a release set.

Fork-Patch: diag-compose-scroll-content-size-trace

Signed-off-by: Codex-Android-DevOPS <codex-android-devops@agents.raft>

diff --git a/compose/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/tencent/kuikly/compose/gestures/KuiklyScrollInfo.kt b/compose/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/tencent/kuikly/compose/gestures/KuiklyScrollInfo.kt
